  characterName: Indira Rathod
  promptText: A solar company wants the empty desert around our village for a huge
    solar farm. They will fit panels on our roofs and fund the clinic my daughter
    badly needs. Do I give up our communal land for solar power?
  leftAnswer: Yes, accept the project; a clinic and power will lift many lives.
  rightAnswer: No, refuse; the commons and the life it supports are worth more.
